    (property "Description" "SHOU HAN TYPE-C 24PLT-H10.5 - USB Type-C receptacle, 24 position + shell (pin 25), VERTICAL SMD. USB 3.1 Gen2 and DP Alt Mode. Mouth 10.50 mm above the board. DRAWING ratings 20 V / 3 A / 5000 cycles / -30..+80 C - the LCSC listing claims 5 A / 10000 cycles / -40..+85 C and is wrong on all three, do not correct these back from the catalogue page. 5000 cycles is HALF the outgoing right-angle C456013 and is the one real regression in the swap. Replaces TYPE-C-24P-QCHT on the usbc daughterboard." (id 6) (at 0 0 0)
